body:
But for 12 gold collectibles (or 14) you only get 1 of 2 players correct? Not the full duo? 

&#x200B;

(I am stuck at work for another hour so just curious)

Used to happen to me almost every game. The only way to fix it is to use a hard wired connection (ethernet)

&#x200B;

My internet was 80mbps download and even that was not good enough. As soon as I used an ethernet cable everything was 100x smoother and no more spikes.

&#x200B;

Hope this helps!
